%% Legend: verified from client-preview/index.ts. Note the non-atomic count then insert (SEC-01).
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client (preview.html#token)
  participant F as Edge: client-preview (no JWT)
  participant DB as Supabase DB
  participant S as Staff
  C->>F: POST {action:feedback, token, name, message}
  F->>DB: share by token (enabled, not expired)
  F->>DB: count feedback last hour (plan)
  Note over F,DB: limit 60/h per plan; race between count and insert
  F->>DB: insert content_feedback (+ plan status if change/approve_all)
  F->>DB: notify admins + creator + publisher (+ push)
  DB-->>S: notifications / push
  F->>DB: audit (userId null)
  F-->>C: {success:true}
